{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019nqvT85g1vMtPLJSqXjeBw","type":"tool_result","content":"=== FAQ 0831 ===\n12:recorded only duration, passing score, and two absences. The 08-23 file's\n21:## What score is needed to pass the exam?\n23:\"A score of 75% or above must be earned to pass the Multiple Choice Exam.\"\n25:## How is my exam scored?\n27:\"Upon completion, exams are scored automatically and barring any exceptions or technical difficulties, a score report will be sent to the candidate via email within 24 hours from the time that the exam was completed.\"\n35:\"Candidates have the option to retake and pass the exam to renew their certification. Certification Renewal must be completed prior to the certification expiration date. The renewed certification will remain current for a further 2 years effective from the date the exam is passed.\"\n37:\"Under the CARE program, passing a higher-level exam will automatically renew Associate-level certifications listed below.\"\n92:Acceptable forms include: \"International travel passport\", \"Government-issued","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6decbd5a-7bd8-4b02-adf6-9af1ae0134f4","uuid":"df4295fe-88d4-4e85-a2c0-a990b27fed51","timestamp":"2026-08-31T23:50:52.904Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== FAQ 0831 ===\n12:recorded only duration, passing score, and two absences. The 08-23 file's\n21:## What score is needed to pass the exam?\n23:\"A score of 75% or above must be earned to pass the Multiple Choice Exam.\"\n25:## How is my exam scored?\n27:\"Upon completion, exams are scored automatically and barring any exceptions or technical difficulties, a score report will be sent to the candidate via email within 24 hours from the time that the exam was completed.\"\n35:\"Candidates have the option to retake and pass the exam to renew their certification. Certification Renewal must be completed prior to the certification expiration date. The renewed certification will remain current for a further 2 years effective from the date the exam is passed.\"\n37:\"Under the CARE program, passing a higher-level exam will automatically renew Associate-level certifications listed below.\"\n92:Acceptable forms include: \"International travel passport\", \"Government-issued","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
